OL,7,FRussell Brand has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,9,Fsexual assault
OL,11,FThe comedian and actor, 51, faced seven
OL,12,Fcounts: three of rape, three of sexual
OL,13,Fassault and one of attempted indecent
OL,14,Fassault
OL,16,FThe allegations date from 1999 to 2009
OL,17,Fand concerned six women. They are all
OL,18,Fentitled to lifelong anonymity
